  <History Date="17-12-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="03-02-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added channel counts to mode names.  Added physical pan/tilt ranges." />
  <History Date="03-02-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed dimmer to intensity in HSI modes and linked to vdim for compatibility" />
  <History Date="03-02-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's (note channel count mismatch for PERSON1, PERSON2 and CMY modes.  Existing agrees with supplied documentation)" />
  <History Date="24-07-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed name from Pluto 2000XE to Pluto 2000XE (SS646XCE).  Added RDM ID's." />
  <History Date="12-03-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added alternative modes (there appears to be two manuals with different charts.  no indication of version or why)" />
  <History Date="16-03-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Swapped PERSON1, PERSON2 and CMY Atlabase ID's to the 13, 21 and 15 channel versions." />
  <History Date="11-04-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Silver Star Pluto 2000XE (SS646XCE)" />
  <History Date="13-04-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." />
